sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant T as Triage
  participant F as CandidateFinder
  participant P as PlayerSession
  participant V as VLC processes
  participant L as FlatLinkResolver
  participant R as FileRemover
  participant K as KeptList
  T->>F: iterate (lazy)
  F-->>T: (path, duration) x batch
  T->>P: open(paths)
  P->>V: start one process per file
  P->>P: wait start_window, flag early exits
  U->>V: close unwanted windows
  U->>T: Enter
  T->>P: classify()
  P-->>T: closed / open / errors
  T->>L: flat_names(closed file)
  L-->>T: _flat links (same inode)
  T->>U: summary, confirm?
  U-->>T: y
  T->>P: close_all()
  loop closed files
    T->>R: remove(original), remove(_flat links)
  end
  T->>K: add(open files)
